# Museum labels in Russian: хранимый, изучаемый, любимый
subtitle: "Read Russian museum labels and make your own -емый and -имый participles: храни́м becomes храни́мый, изуча́ем becomes изуча́емый."
tags: ["russian","russian participles","museum in russian","хранимый","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/participles","vocabulary/museum"]
thumb: "band \"Read a Russian museum label\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Whatever happens in Russian: что бы ни, как ни, где бы ни","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/197-russian-whatever-happens.cast"}

## Museum labels in Russian: хранимый, изучаемый, любимый
