audio:
  lang: en
  lines:
    '|a||Museum labels in Russian: хранимый, изучаемый, любимый':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Read Russian museum labels and make your own -емый and -имый participles: храни́м becomes храни́мый, изуча́ем becomes изуча́емый.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:t5fmkd'
    '|a||Янва́рь. В музе́е у Ма́ши но́вая вы́ставка: портре́ты. Портре́т is a portrait.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6920
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ве́чером Ма́ша звони́т мне. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ys0i6m'
    '|b||Том, послу́шай мою́ этике́тку: «Портре́т, храни́мый в музе́е с ты́сяча девятисо́того го́да».':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5960
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:qbsna1'
    '|a||Храни́мый? Что э́то зна́чит?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Кото́рый храни́тся. Так пи́шут на этике́тках.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3480
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||А кто э́тот бога́тый мужчи́на?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2640
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Мы не зна́ем. И кто худо́жник, то́же не зна́ем.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3760
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||А э́та же́нщина с кни́гой?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2440
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Писа́тель восемна́дцатого ве́ка. Её портре́т — люби́мая карти́на посети́телей.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5440
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||What is Masha writing for her museum? (этике́тка = a label)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5520
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Этике́тка: a label for a portrait.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3560
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||In Masha''s label, since when has the portrait been in the museum?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4760
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||С ты́сяча девятисо́того го́да.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2520
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Who is the rich man in the portrait on Masha''s label? (бога́тый мужчи́на = a rich man)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7600
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Мы не зна́ем: nobody knows.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3160
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||In Masha''s label, who is the woman with the book? (же́нщина = a woman)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Писа́тель восемна́дцатого ве́ка.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2360
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Посмотри́те. Портре́т, храни́мый в музе́е. Храни́ть: to keep.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5680
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ма́ша сказа́ла: кото́рый храни́тся. Э́то одно́ и то́ же: храни́мый means which is kept.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:174x497'
    '|a||Так пи́шут на этике́тках, в кни́гах, в но́востях. А когда́ мы говори́м, то обы́чно кото́рый.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1tvdv95'
    '|a||Но́вые слова́. Мужчи́на, же́нщина, бога́тый: a man, a woman, rich.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1putivm'
    '|a||Худо́жник, an artist. Писа́тель, a writer.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1rkm2e'
    '|a||Предме́т, an object. Стари́нный, antique. Эпо́ха, an era.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1tx5xlz'
    '|a||Посети́тели, visitors. Изобража́ть, to show in a picture. Повтори́те.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:n43qav'
    '|a||Как сде́лать тако́е сло́во? Посмотри́те на «мы».':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:nqpvu4'
    '|a||Храни́ть: мы храни́м. Add an adjective ending: храни́мый.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:97q8ji'
    '|a||Изуча́ть: мы изуча́ем, изуча́емый.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:6og47h'
    '|a||Люби́ть: мы лю́бим, люби́мый. You know люби́мый from lesson 152: it is one of these.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:j2fffk'
    '|a||Изобража́ть: мы изобража́ем, изобража́емый.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:yhrc1y'
    '|a||Ем or им, the gold piece: mostly the мы-form decides. The ending follows the noun, like но́вый. Not every verb has this form: писа́ть and пить do not.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 14080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1d47xhv'
    '|a||Ча́шка, храни́мая в музе́е. On labels the phrase usually stands after the noun, between commas.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:qg7yil'
    '|a||Портре́т, люби́мый посети́телями. Кто лю́бит? Посети́тели: посети́телями, the with-ending, in blue.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:89ricz'
    '|a||Тепе́рь три этике́тки Ма́ши. Прочита́йте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:d4uy0m'
    '|b||Портре́т бога́того мужчи́ны, храни́мый в музе́е с ты́сяча девятисо́того го́да.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5240
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1gwjvfn'
    '|b||Стари́нная ча́шка эпо́хи Петра́ Пе́рвого.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2880
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:9njcn5'
    '|b||Предме́т, люби́мый посети́телями.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2800
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:bbfp5r'
    '|b||Письмо́ писа́теля дру́гу, изуча́емое студе́нтами.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3920
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1orx1xl'
    '|a||В ка́ждой этике́тке — тако́е сло́во: храни́мый, люби́мый, изуча́емое.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:jzufgb'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы. Посмотри́те на «мы».':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:7ftjic'
    '|a||Запо́лните про́пуски.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:mlcgnf'
    '|a||Ча́шка, храни́мая в музе́е. Пи́сьма, изуча́емые студе́нтами.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5640
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ещё два.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:zscw2m'
    '|a||Запо́лните про́пуски: -емый or -имый, with the right ending.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:112isgl'
    '|a||Худо́жник, люби́мый Ма́шей. Мужчи́на, изобража́емый на портре́те: мужчи́на — он, зна́чит -ый. Молоде́ц!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12600
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Напиши́те по-ру́сски: a picture loved by visitors.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:110u48g'
    '|a||Напиши́те по-ру́сски:':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:v5jnez'
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Карти́на, люби́мая посети́телями.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Суббо́та. Я в за́ле с Ма́шей. По́сле диало́га нажми́те Practise.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5800
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Шесть вопро́сов. Понеде́льник, до вы́ставки. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:12ft5sm'
    '|a||Ма́ша, когда́ открыва́ется твоя́ вы́ставка?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1r5xdps'
    '|b||В суббо́ту. Мы ждём мно́го посети́телей.':
