      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What does Masha like most at her exhibition?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Пи́сьма писа́теля восемна́дцатого ве́ка.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3440
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Запо́лните про́пуски: a museum label.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1n29mgh'
    '|a||Портре́т, изуча́емый студе́нтами, — люби́мый предме́т посети́телей.':
      mp3: 
